OL,3,CFour men arrested following violent
OL,4,Cdisorder near Pontypool
OL,6,FFour men have been arrested after
OL,7,Freports of violent disorder in
OL,8,FPontnewynydd, near Pontypool.
OL,10,FOfficers from Gwent Police were called
OL,11,Fto Mill Road at around 7.15pm on
OL,12,FThursday August 6th.
OL,14,FFirearms officers and the National
OL,15,FPolice Air Service, alongside
OL,16,Fparamedics from the Welsh Ambulance
OL,17,FService were all in attendance at the
OL,18,Fscene on Thursday evening.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/3
