OL,3,CFour men arrested following violent
OL,4,Cdisorder near Pontypool
OL,6,FThree of the men were taken to
OL,7,Fhospital for treatment, with two of
OL,8,Fthem currently in a critical condition.
OL,10,FDetective Chief Superintendent Anne-
OL,11,FMarie Salwey said: ''We recognise that
OL,12,Freports of this nature will prompt
OL,13,Fconcern from our residents and it is
OL,14,Flikely that you will see officers in
OL,15,Fand around the area conducting
OL,16,Fenquiries as part of this
OL,17,Finvestigation.''
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/3
