OL,3,CFour men arrested following violent
OL,4,Cdisorder near Pontypool
OL,6,FGwent Police are now urging members of
OL,7,Fthe public who may hold CCTV or
OL,8,Fdashcam footage in the area to contact
OL,9,Fthem.
OL,11,FThe road between Mill Road and
OL,12,FHospital Road remains closed in both
OL,13,Fdirections with diversions in place.
